    "turn_text": "Well, those started out with preschoolers and second, third and fourth graders reading to those the kids at the school. It was just celebrating reading. My message to the kids was that through reading and through learning, they can do anything they want. They wanted to know if I'd met the President of the United States. And so we talked a little bit about",
